Z||000000||batboy||08-08-99||03:53 PM||||Ok, I got a free homepage, so I made a simple, cheesy, and totally lame website that is my shrine to my V8 powered Fiero Batmobile. Hey, I've never made a web page before! The site contains several pages of mostly photos, so please be patient as it will take a few seconds to load. I have plenty of room to put Fiero Forum patrons' Fiero pictures on. Go to the Fiero Forum Foto link to see Greendano's yellow GT. Send me a photo and your car will be on the internet too. Check it out!<p>http://sites.netscape.net/batboybain/batmobile
