Z||000008||batboy||08-13-99||05:04 PM||||Thanks for all the favorable response on my website. I've got a great number of emails about the Batmobile pages too. I've already made some changes, shuffled some stuff around, and added some more pages, including a brand new "links" page. A buddy of mine who has done several websites (he's not a Fiero owner) told me that repeatedly sending people to a secondary page then back to the main page again and again was annoying. I agreed with him, so I swapped in a set of "next page" links for a much smoother ride through the website. Bookmark my site and check back in every few weeks. I'm hoping to keep improving the site, keep reporting progress made on the Batmobile, and I'm going to create a separate performance figures page in the future. I also added Sluppy123's "Pair of Fieros" photo to the Fiero Forum Foto page.
